cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this package, please cite the paper and this repository."
title: "Financial data version risk in bankruptcy model validation: separating scoring, development and evaluation effects"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for a crossed version validation protocol that separates
  substitution of scoring inputs, redevelopment of the fitted pipeline and selection of
  the evaluated population when historical financial data values change across reported
  versions. Contains frozen derived inputs, analysis code, saved predictions, figures,
  tables and the manuscript.
authors:
